{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01JDoR8oE559mf1Ait8zmzk3","type":"tool_result","content":"// `microtags/preact`, default (Node and SSR) build. Renders the host\n// tag with its attributes and inner HTML from the component's render\n// parts, so `renderToString` matches the `render` static. Imports\n// render support, as the build transform does for a kept render link\n// (ADR-009). See ADR-010.\nimport { h, type VNode } from 'preact'\nimport './render-support.js'\nimport {\n    splitProps,\n    type EventMap,\n    type PreactComponent,\n    type PreactElementClass,\n    type ToPreactOptions,\n} from './preact-shared.js'\n\nexport type {\n    DeclaredProps,\n    EventMap,\n    PassthroughProps,\n    PreactComponent,\n    PreactElementClass,\n    PreactProps,\n    ToPreactOptions,\n} from './preact-shared.js'\n\n/**\n * Wrap a microtags element class as a Preact component. Preact owns the\n * host and its attributes; the element owns the host's children.\n */\nexport function toPreact<\n    C extends PreactElementClass,\n    E extends EventMap = Record<never, never>,\n> (El:C, options?:ToPreactOptions<E>):PreactComponent<C, E> {\n    const events:EventMap = options?.events ?? {}\n    return (props:Record<string, unknown>):VNode<any> => {\n        const { own, rest } = splitProps(El, events, props)\n        if (!El.renderParts) {\n            throw new Error(\n                `microtags/preact: <${El.TAG}> has no render link. On ` +\n                'the server, import the variant of this component that ' +\n                'keeps its render link.'\n            )\n        }\n        const extra:Record<string, string> = {}\n        for (const k in rest) {\n            if (rest[k] != null) extra[k] = String(rest[k])\n        }\n        const { tag, attrs, html } = El.renderParts(own, { attrs: extra })\n        const vprops:Record<string, unknown> = {}\n        for (const k in attrs) vprops[k] = attrs[k] === '' ? true : attrs[k]\n        vprops.dangerouslySetInnerHTML = { __html: html }\n        return h(tag, vprops)\n    }\n}\n28:    'prop-only' | 'schema' | 'boolean' | 'json' | 'coercer'\n63:    prop: <T>(initial:T):PropertyOnlyProp<T> => (\n267:                'prop-only' as const :\n# Changelog\n\nAll notable changes to this project will be documented in this file.\n\nThe format is based on [Keep a Changelog](https://keepachangelog.com/en/1.0.0/)\nand this project adheres to [Semantic Versioning](https://semver.org/spec/v2.0.0.html).\n\nGenerated by [`auto-changelog`](https://github.com/CookPete/auto-changelog).\n\n## [v0.0.14](https://github.com/nichoth/microtags/compare/v0.0.13...v0.0.14)\n\n### Commits\n\n- better docs [`1d13372`](https://github.com/nichoth/microtags/commit/1d1337220b521bd184cccae18da5ba4cf70ebb05)\n\n## [v0.0.13](https://github.com/nichoth/microtags/compare/v0.0.12...v0.0.13) - 2026-09-22\n\n### Commits\n\n- fix package.json [`65281d6`](https://github.com/nichoth/microtags/commit/65281d65624e231185983714fa5d5895ec500777)\n- fix lint [`97142aa`](https://github.com/nichoth/microtags/commit/97142aa40c404e2e1452e4c1153686cf0d515210)\n\n## [v0.0.12](https://github.com/nichoth/microtags/compare/v0.0.11...v0.0.12) - 2026-07-01\n\n### Commits\n\n- better docs [`348444f`](https://github.com/nichoth/microtags/commit/348444f34d1496b6670337174b90e2abfe74ac04)\n\n## [v0.0.11](https://github.com/nichoth/microtags/compare/v0.0.10...v0.0.11) - 2026-07-01\n\n## [v0.0.10](https://github.com/nichoth/microtags/compare/v0.0.9...v0.0.10) - 2026-07-01\n\n### Commits\n\n- better docs [`b49288d`](https://github.com/nichoth/microtags/commit/b49288d985988dd659acc79f7aa6d7b38b5a9919)\n- better docs [`9fa07f5`](https://github.com/nichoth/microtags/commit/9fa07f580978b86cf4d0df8bdaa15909a1aff6d5)\n- docs [`7bc8c2c`](https://github.com/nichoth/microtags/commit/7bc8c2ca517e4005fd6b33d8af5a58dbdb2b3d29)\n\n## [v0.0.9](https://github.com/nichoth/microtags/compare/v0.0.8...v0.0.9) - 2026-06-29\n\n251: 