{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01LRxkq4TDQb1DuEdwmHAuUi","type":"tool_result","content":"## Consequences\n\n- No Preact children. The adapter does not accept them: passing them is\n  a type error, and the adapter throws in development. Slotting vnodes\n  into element-owned markup is out of scope.\n- The browser build of `microtags/preact` carries no render code. It\n  does not import render support. A client-only mount calls the\n  class's `renderParts`, so it needs the variant that keeps its render\n  link and render support registered (the build transform imports it\n  for a kept render link), so with every render link stripped\n  a client bundle stays as small as ADR-004 requires.","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"4c0eb7c9-4c49-4c5f-bbb4-d093463c7645","uuid":"dc629aa2-ab5c-4b41-9754-9169a14c02a8","timestamp":"2026-11-09T06:28:04.965Z","tool_use_result":{"stdout":"## Consequences\n\n- No Preact children. The adapter does not accept them: passing them is\n  a type error, and the adapter throws in development. Slotting vnodes\n  into element-owned markup is out of scope.\n- The browser build of `microtags/preact` carries no render code. It\n  does not import render support. A client-only mount calls the\n  class's `renderParts`, so it needs the variant that keeps its render\n  link and render support registered (the build transform imports it\n  for a kept render link), so with every render link stripped\n  a client bundle stays as small as ADR-004 requires.","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false,"bashEditDiff":{"files":[{"filePath":"/Users/nick/code/microtags.review-fix/docs/adr/ADR-010-preact-adapter-ownership-split.md","hunks":[{"oldStart":52,"oldLines":22,"newStart":52,"newLines":26,"lines":[" link was stripped has no `renderParts`, so the adapter throws an error"," that names the tag."," ","-**In the browser**, the adapter gives the host one shared, fixed","-